Project "1" -- "1..*" Requirement : uses
Project "1" -- "0..*" System : produces
Requirement "1" -- "0..*" System : validated by testing against
Requirement "1" -- "0..*" Publication : published via
System "1" -- "0..*" Platform : deployed onto

@enduml

